<title>BELGIUM: Ibel 1996 net profit, dividend rises.</title>
<headline>Ibel 1996 net profit, dividend rises.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996 (in millions of Belgian francs unless stated):</p>
<p>    Cons net profit		     979.7  vs  747.6</p>
<p>    Cons current profit		 504.4  vs  471.3</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)	     122.0  vs  113.5</p>
<p>    Dividend payment date	     May 21</p>
<p>Net asset value/share</p>
<p>    (francs)  at Dec 31		 6,474  vs  5,383</p>
<p>		  at Jan 31, 1997	 6,834  vs  5,833</p>
<p>NOTE - Ibel is a Belgian holding company</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
